# Example (kind profile). The grouped GEMM's counters before a lever on it. The band is the
# expectation written beside the recipe ncu-gpu-gemm in the justfile [derived,
# docs/research/q3next-design-report.md sections 3 and 6].
kind: profile
question: which unit carries gemm_q4k's block-step in the Qwen3 ubatch GEMM (128 experts of
  768 x 2048 Q4_K, top-8, T = 4096)?
term: L1TEX throughput in percent of peak (ncu), and whether it is the top unit
unit: %
predict: 55..65
condition: ncu takes 16 eager gemm_q4k launches after the 64-launch warm-up burst on the A6000
  (just ncu-gpu-gemm), under the lease; guard_other records any process on the 3090
decide-in: write every unit's demand beside the block-step's cycles before a lever on L1TEX
  wavefronts: the top unit is the bound only when its demand is the step (AGENTS.md)
decide-below: another unit is on top: rank the units by demand against the step's cycles and aim
  at the one whose demand is the step
decide-above: L1TEX is near saturation: price a wavefront cut on the same demand-against-cycles
  table before a round
